Run paused for analyst review. Resume it (same process) with, for example:
  python -m aml_alert_triage.main --use-langgraph --customer-id cust-214 --thread-id cust-214 --analyst-decision confirm-escalation

Note: the built-in checkpointer is in-memory only, so resuming only works within the same process/run - a durable checkpointer (e.g. SqliteSaver) would be needed to resume across separate CLI invocations.
